[{"title":"承叶别驾见访奉柬二首 其一","author":"吴与弼","text":"窗下书生报，门前使客临。\n形容惊喜定，情话别离深。\n风月江山趣，冰霜松柏心。\n平生觅同调，几处得知音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9240,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"承叶别驾见访奉柬二首 其二","author":"吴与弼","text":"白雪阳春调，长吟莫厌多。\n功夫既积累，律吕自谐和。\n江海犹疏凿，圭璋藉琢磨。\n人生谁不学，志向各如何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9241,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忆荣上舍","author":"吴与弼","text":"江馆春相遇，乡心晚益知。\n青云持节日，短褐省亲时。\n高谊能分禄，空囊只赠诗。\n别来消息断，几欲到分宜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9242,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"买药","author":"吴与弼","text":"生涯惟病绊，人事与心违。\n岁月一身晚，江湖孤梦飞。\n忧深多为道，贫惯任无衣。\n抱布街头去，新晴买药归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9243,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即事","author":"吴与弼","text":"欲识阳和景，四时惟有春。\n风光三月半，霁色独吟频。\n露叶浑如醉，烟花不择贫。\n人心长自小，宁解化工仁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9244,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感怀","author":"吴与弼","text":"易白颜回发，难升孔子堂。\n常时思寡过，终岁未成章。\n万物人皆备，一心谁不良。\n如何空潦倒，甘让昔贤芳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9245,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"绝句","author":"吴与弼","text":"新诗尽日恣冥搜，尘世悠悠任去留。\n兴到江山随处览，不知身外有閒愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9246,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨柳","author":"吴与弼","text":"婵娟杨柳枝，烟雨涵芳姿。\n托根近孤松，苍翠相因依。\n颇谓颜色好，可同岁寒期。\n岂知霜未坠，素叶先纷飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9247,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"圃内","author":"吴与弼","text":"长夏日已晚，归鸟皆投林。\n幽独悦兹圃，把书行且吟。\n花竹流芳净，蔬果生意深。\n两间有妙趣，长契静者心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9248,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四月四日","author":"吴与弼","text":"客床起复眠，中心怅遐慕。\n嗟我庭中亲，兹旦惟初度。\n岂独别离深，鬓发久垂素。\n形留空役神，迢迢滞江路。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9249,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿章广文馆","author":"吴与弼","text":"虚斋罢清话，拂床事枕席。\n青灯灭馀烬，斜月流素壁。\n弟子富书声，感之增叹息。\n沉痾久缠绵，那由共兹夕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9250,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠章广文","author":"吴与弼","text":"俗情素寡合，独往欲无言。\n伊谁写湮郁，喜得章澹然。\n丝萝托世好，金兰契忘年。\n青眼饶故意，白云多新篇。\n顾兹蹉跎志，怀古共勉旃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9251,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"茂树","author":"吴与弼","text":"古垣有茂树，婆娑广成帷。\n霜雪根本固，雨露枝叶肥。\n蒙密自昏晓，静爱众鸟归。\n此物尚有容，吾心谅何为。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9252,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月夜忆友人","author":"吴与弼","text":"阶除境向寂，客思渺无依。\n美兹风月夕，正是怀人时。\n欲叙平生心，相见各未期。\n百年若流水，如何长别离。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9253,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画马","author":"吴与弼","text":"有客遣弟子，持示双马图。\n丹青固妙笔，所拟皆龙驹。\n一龙嘶青云，一龙困盐车。\n逸气含变态，病骨森清癯。\n既遭伯乐顾，绝足乃得纾。\n未遇善自保，饱秣青山刍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9254,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游北禅寺","author":"吴与弼","text":"入门闻花香，傍砌看花色。\n花香细而清，花色洁以白。\n薰风院深沉，亭午人閒寂。\n悠哉羲皇上，着此忘机客。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9255,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"栖凤竹","author":"吴与弼","text":"庭宇肃深沉，苍翠交梧竹。\n众鸟从纷飞，时看凤来宿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9256,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人赴春闱","author":"吴与弼","text":"画省身先达，春闱气正豪。\n功名方自负，关塞岂辞劳。\n黄道中天近，青云北极高。\n胪传知得意，端笏继夔皋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9257,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柬朱学正先生","author":"吴与弼","text":"伊昔起予深，相逢久别心。\n老成欣德重，薄劣愧年侵。\n夜雨添新思，秋风忆旧吟。\n正期谈笑密，还念欲分襟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9258,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"不寐","author":"吴与弼","text":"寒鼓三更后，孤衾未睡时。\n无穷身外事，逐一静中思。\n圣域何由入，灵台久自私。\n疏棂霜月白，愁况漫裁诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9259,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"览旧游","author":"吴与弼","text":"高树春风花正开，芒鞋曾记屡徘徊。\n如今花落年光莫，寒色斜阳又独来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9260,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中见梅花","author":"吴与弼","text":"茅庵深处路萦斜，老树遥看近腊花。\n何事幽人吟未到，游蜂先已得春华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9261,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"述怀","author":"吴与弼","text":"风雨春天晓，江山客梦醒。\n浮沉谁共慰，出处独含情。\n得善惭颜氏，传经忆伏生。\n经过人事略，何意钓时名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9262,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春夜","author":"吴与弼","text":"千古兴怀洙泗滨，无由一接杏坛春。\n自怜弱质生来晚，空作纷纷世上人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9263,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忆九韶","author":"吴与弼","text":"春泥滑滑阴连朝，出门跬步难逍遥。\n阳和黯然舒蔼蔼，风雨倏忽来萧萧。\n客怀思见故人面，云山阻绝谁相招。\n故人隐居萝溪曲，残书破砚甘寂寥。\n奉亲常惧岁月速，学古不使子弟骄。\n躬耕低头秋谷熟，击壤皞皞歌唐尧。\n平生于我谊不薄，松柏宁向秋风凋。\n愧我崎岖昧生理，托身在处云飘飘。\n何时归来葺茅屋，与子共种黄精苗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9264,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"出城","author":"吴与弼","text":"行行共吾侄，诵诗出城郭。\n白日皎青天，风光胜于昨。\n岭外更峰峦，村边总花萼。\n扰扰行路人，谁识予心乐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9265,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新庄渡","author":"吴与弼","text":"渡头舟已发，随意坐芳洲。\n白石聊为砚，题诗蘸碧流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9266,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"道中作九首 其一","author":"吴与弼","text":"临渠爱流水，试砚涉还歇。\n起看碎米花，疑残去年雪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9267,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"道中作九首 其二","author":"吴与弼","text":"眺望觉日迟，经过忘前后。\n牧唱儿童閒，黄牛满丘阜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9268,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"道中作九首 其三","author":"吴与弼","text":"丛竹夹桃花，清池映高下。\n世上有丹青，笔底谁能画。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9269,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"道中作九首 其四","author":"吴与弼","text":"爱景时回立，烟村澹相对。\n惆怅百年人，此心几人会。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9270,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"道中作九首 其五","author":"吴与弼","text":"呼童汲清泚，怡然坐临池。\n谁能知我怀，细雨来催诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9271,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"道中作九首 其六","author":"吴与弼","text":"人生得丈夫，万一幸为儒。\n寸心含宇宙，不乐复何如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9272,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"道中作九首 其七","author":"吴与弼","text":"纸笔不暂离，琴书恒自随。\n欲忧身外事，何日是閒时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9273,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"道中作九首 其八","author":"吴与弼","text":"得诗万事轻，性达频爵跃。\n翘首吟未回，松风度寥廓。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9274,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"道中作九首 其九","author":"吴与弼","text":"微雨已滑途，行客未堪住。\n遥问读书斋，正在花深处。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9275,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"友人至","author":"吴与弼","text":"独绕烟村来，共兹玩云月。\n细雨夜已阑，深意殊未歇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9276,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓起即事 其一","author":"吴与弼","text":"夜思经世务，神倦方熟眠。\n晨朝气清爽，良心还烱然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9277,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓起即事 其二","author":"吴与弼","text":"条风暖雨来，晨烟村冥漠。\n北牖时独开，纷纷李花落。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9278,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"录诗稿","author":"吴与弼","text":"晴日鸟相唤，轻风花乱飞。\n红尘休入户，次第正抄诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9279,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客玩夜月","author":"吴与弼","text":"静来悟道机，窔奥难言说。\n但得此心安，从处堪乘月。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9280,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"纵步","author":"吴与弼","text":"幽花发清香，芳林涨新绿。\n閒听山中禽，更倚篱边竹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9281,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"友人至 其一","author":"吴与弼","text":"整屦欲有往，故人忽西来。\n盎然阳春怀，共向东风开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9282,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"友人至 其二","author":"吴与弼","text":"平生慕克己，茫然靡所获。\n今日欣语君，至乐颇洋溢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9283,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"觉后","author":"吴与弼","text":"觉来气宇澄，开牖东林下。\n缺月五更头，寒光皎清夜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9284,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"村中即事","author":"吴与弼","text":"春光被四野，行欣物华茂。\n寂寂竹林边，幽禽语清昼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9285,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"胡十见访客馆值予暂出承候迎村外遂相与叙旧同宿得诗六首 其一","author":"吴与弼","text":"归步夕阳迟，和风满襟袖。\n矫首清溪傍，芳畦故人候。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9286,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"胡十见访客馆值予暂出承候迎村外遂相与叙旧同宿得诗六首 其二","author":"吴与弼","text":"梅花残腊时，访予五峰上。\n讵知萍梗踪，春光此同赏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9287,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"胡十见访客馆值予暂出承候迎村外遂相与叙旧同宿得诗六首 其三","author":"吴与弼","text":"我归惊十年，回首如信宿。\n惆怅谪仙吟，人生鸟过目。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9288,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"胡十见访客馆值予暂出承候迎村外遂相与叙旧同宿得诗六首 其四","author":"吴与弼","text":"忆子有立年，曾与论耿介。\n吾今越斯境，事业怜安在。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9289,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"胡十见访客馆值予暂出承候迎村外遂相与叙旧同宿得诗六首 其五","author":"吴与弼","text":"既罢溪上游，复向篱边坐。\n夜景良可人，谁能即高卧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9290,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"胡十见访客馆值予暂出承候迎村外遂相与叙旧同宿得诗六首 其六","author":"吴与弼","text":"交期相惠好，青灯共斯阁。\n话言杂今昔，心事兼悲乐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9291,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"昼寝觉","author":"吴与弼","text":"日净风暄清昼迟，绿阴啼鸟梦醒时。\n间窗笔砚无尘杂，幽事宜人又得诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9292,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读中庸","author":"吴与弼","text":"一理存乎静，万事著于微。\n是以君子心，战兢恒自持。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9293,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"弹琴","author":"吴与弼","text":"寂寥春夜间，几阁孤灯照。\n邈尔形役忘，丝桐正清妙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9294,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"琴罢","author":"吴与弼","text":"琴罢诗兴来，残灯独挥笔。\n因识圣人心，澹然何意必。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9295,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别锁秀才","author":"吴与弼","text":"觅渡临清流，故人更同舟。\n细语昨日诗，别怀总悠悠。\n送送山之麓，春花多踯躅。\n长揖东风前，浮生两相勖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9296,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梦严亲","author":"吴与弼","text":"江山久离居，薄养那得及。\n髣髴何处庭，承颜梦中立。\n天性良固有，深爱成长泣。\n涕泪泫莫收，晓起衾犹湿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9297,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"牛氏东轩","author":"吴与弼","text":"名花散奇香，幽苔多净绿。\n清昼轩中人，琴书自相续。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9298,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感旧游","author":"吴与弼","text":"石桥门巷落花深，晴日光风鸟乱吟。\n人事暗随春梦换，绿杨还似旧时阴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9299,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柬徐广文","author":"吴与弼","text":"学问无少长，立志夫何如。\n勉强柔即强，惰慢明亦愚。\n光景勿云盛，容易垂桑榆。\n年侵勿自画，为仁果谁欤。\n一私诚自窒，荡荡斯广居。\n深切累日月，圣贤途岂殊。\n勉旃黉宫彦，勇往毋踟蹰。\n莫嫌??言，素心不能谀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9300,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"上顿渡舟中","author":"吴与弼","text":"驱驰年少未应劳，万事无心任所遭。\n收拾琴书辞故郡，江山随处是诗豪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9301,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜坐","author":"吴与弼","text":"雨滴空阶响，灯悬净壁明。\n掩书人独坐，性达正惺惺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9302,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蕲春采芹亭同罗黄二广文登","author":"吴与弼","text":"名亭极虚敞，英友携登临。\n石池湛寒水，茂树围幽阴。\n久坐得胜趣，剧谈延赏心。\n薄游庆佳遇，因以书狂吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9303,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题一丘轩","author":"吴与弼","text":"种此一丘田，朝夕恒精虔。\n众草不敢秽，瓜瓞斯绵绵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9304,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄胡九韶","author":"吴与弼","text":"去家已十日，作客无尽期。\n悟道达浮生，浩荡随所之。\n荣枯藐毫忽，得失轻铢锱。\n闻味圣贤道，谩吟今古诗。\n胜境多独得，佳兴良自知。\n寄言故乡友，身心善矜持。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9305,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谒濂溪晦庵二先生祠二首 其一","author":"吴与弼","text":"孔孟微言几欲绝，先生千载续真传。\n偶经灵宇增新感，遗绪寥寥苦简编。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9306,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谒濂溪晦庵二先生祠二首 其二","author":"吴与弼","text":"平生慨慕古人深，道味先生更所钦。\n长恨无缘趋末席，灵祠一拜俨如临。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9307,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梦亲","author":"吴与弼","text":"欲写离肠苦，无言下笔难。\n奉欢何日遂，梦里暂承颜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9308,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登舟入楚","author":"吴与弼","text":"步出湓城吊古馀，前程又复即舟居。\n客身到处无荣辱，随分萧条两箧书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9309,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梦慈闱","author":"吴与弼","text":"昊天罔极裂心肝，遗冢荒凉不忍看。\n魂梦岂知生死隔，承颜浪喜得真欢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9310,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即事","author":"吴与弼","text":"吟觉多情坐不眠，月光涵水水浮天。\n橹声细与歌声协，又有西来夜泊船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9311,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观濂洛关闽诸君子遗像","author":"吴与弼","text":"平生习迂僻，人物常怀古。\n自从尧舜来，历历固可数。\n降兹秦汉下，无才继邹鲁。\n伟哉宋德隆，夫子生四五。\n日月丽中天，远近曷不睹。\n人心一返正，斯道朗以溥。\n嗟我小子愚，私淑岂小补。\n偶从黄卷中，瞻像慰渴慕。\n因像以求心，益自陶莽卤。\n不及犹恐失，谁知此心苦。\n会当写斯图，顷刻恒敬负。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9312,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读易","author":"吴与弼","text":"夏日舒以长，斋内深更静。\n正襟新浴馀，肃容湛天性。\n悠哉四圣心，玩味频起敬。\n好风生坐隅，竹色鲜相映。\n澹尔绝外牵，伊谁共佳兴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9313,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"枕上绝句","author":"吴与弼","text":"贤圣微言玩愈精，夜分无寐独惺惺。\n十年醉梦迷南北，一点寒山雪后青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9314,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]